{"id": "6287", "type": "post", "slug": "revitalized-water", "path": "revitalized-water", "title": "Revitalized Water", "date": "2012-05-31 00:00:00", "modified": "2025-05-30 16:13:40", "excerpt": "To solve this hydration problem, they assigned one of their top scientists, Professor Victor M. Inyushin, who developed a multi-stage restorative system.", "content": "\n            <p>To solve this hydration problem, they assigned one of their top scientists, Professor Victor M. Inyushin, who developed a multi-stage restorative system. This system included the Bio-Plasma Generator and the Geometrical Crystal Field. The Bio-Plasma generator is a device that contains a living vegetable fiber grown and preserved in the vacuum state, which produces a mini-voltage output and creates an energy field that the re-cycled water passes through. The Geometrical Crystal Field creates a biologically compatible frequency that imprints information created by the geometrical figures in natural crystalline structures, such as those in water from natural sources.</p><p>Professor Inyushin has licensed a U.S. based company. Revitalized Technologies, Inc. who further developed this technology to concentrate the plasma and maximize the zeta potential, which multiplies the water's subtle frequencies, in an effort to make it affordable and effective. The company has a number of scientific verification methods for this proven technology, including changes in surface tension, boiling point, and nuclear magnetic resonance, which show smaller organized clusters known as structured water. Over the years, we, at Hippocrates Wellness have been acutely interested in finding more effective methods of enhancing the hydration of the human cell. Adequate hydration significantly accomplishes a primary objective of creating greater electrical frequency among all tissues within the human body. By activating organ, neurological, and brain organ systems, one's immunity is heightened and balanced.</p><p>Approximately one year ago we began experimenting with the resulting water from this Russian technology. there are three clear advantages that we unveiled at Hippocrates when the water is consumed on a daily basis:</p><ol></ol><p>\t</p><li>HIGHER LEVELS OF NUTRIENT ABSORPTION FROM BOTH FOOD AND WHOLE FOOD SUPPLEMENTATION.</li><p></p><p>\t</p><li>GREATER OXYGENATION OF THE RESPIRATORY SYSTEM (TESTED WITH AN OXOMETER).</li><p></p><p>\t</p><li>DEHYDRATION IS MINIMIZED IN CASES OF HEIGHTENED EXERTION, NAUSEA AND FEVER.</li><p></p><p>Each of these attributes is significant in and of themselves, yet in combination, they assist in everyone's healthcare from athletes to people suffering with chronic disease.</p><p>Currently, we offer Revitalized Water to add to all of your drinking and therapeutic water. At the time of this writing we are beginning to develop an enriched Revitalized H<sub>2</sub>0, which will include amino acids and silica. This low cost, high-tech method of enhancing your body's frequency is one of the primary steps for ensuring a Vibrant rife. For more on Revitalized water Visit call the Hippocrates Store at 561.471.8876, ext. 124.</p><p><em>Vol 24 Issue 4 Page 22</em></p>\n        ", "seoTitle": null, "seoDesc": null, "canonical": null, "ogTitle": null, "ogDesc": null, "image": null, "terms": {"category": [{"name": "Archive", "slug": "archive"}]}, "elementor": false, "content_live": "<div data-elementor-type=\"single-post\" data-elementor-id=\"10424\" class=\"elementor elementor-10424 elementor-location-single post-6287 post type-post status-publish format-standard hentry category-archive\" data-elementor-post-type=\"elementor_library\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a228788 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"a228788\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-84599a4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"84599a4\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<p>Category</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-882830b elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-title elementor-page-title elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"882830b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-title.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<h1 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Revitalized Water</h1>\t\t\t\t</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c902231 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-excerpt\" data-id=\"c902231\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-excerpt.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\nTo solve this hydration problem, they assigned one of their top scientists, Professor Victor M. Inyushin, who developed a multi-stage restorative system.\t\t\t\t</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a7fc77a elementor-widget-divider--view-line elementor-widget elementor-widget-divider\" data-id=\"a7fc77a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"divider.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<div class=\"elementor-divider\">\n<span class=\"elementor-divider-separator\">\n</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5e1db06 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"5e1db06\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d74000b e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"d74000b\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5f603ae elementor-author-box--layout-image-left elementor-author-box--align-left elementor-author-box--avatar-yes elementor-author-box--name-yes elementor-author-box--biography-yes elementor-author-box--link-no elementor-widget elementor-widget-author-box\" data-id=\"5f603ae\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"author-box.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<div class=\"elementor-author-box\">\n<div  class=\"elementor-author-box__avatar\">\n<img src=\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/3118645e97f4337e322acbfbea8583c81e273e34b66f2c0a5124b63d16042cee?s=300&#038;d=mm&#038;r=g\" alt=\"Picture of Hippocrates Wellness\" loading=\"lazy\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-author-box__text\">\n<div >\n<h4 class=\"elementor-author-box__name\">\nHippocrates Wellness\t\t\t\t\t\t</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-author-box__bio\">\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-52854c3 elementor-align-right elementor-widget elementor-widget-post-info\" data-id=\"52854c3\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"post-info.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<ul class=\"elementor-inline-items elementor-icon-list-items elementor-post-info\">\n<li class=\"elementor-icon-list-item elementor-repeater-item-b8b399b elementor-inline-item\" itemprop=\"datePublished\">\n<a href=\"/2012/05/31/\">\n<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-icon\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-calendar\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M12 192h424c6.6 0 12 5.4 12 12v260c0 26.5-21.5 48-48 48H48c-26.5 0-48-21.5-48-48V204c0-6.6 5.4-12 12-12zm436-44v-36c0-26.5-21.5-48-48-48h-48V12c0-6.6-5.4-12-12-12h-40c-6.6 0-12 5.4-12 12v52H160V12c0-6.6-5.4-12-12-12h-40c-6.6 0-12 5.4-12 12v52H48C21.5 64 0 85.5 0 112v36c0 6.6 5.4 12 12 12h424c6.6 0 12-5.4 12-12z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-text elementor-post-info__item elementor-post-info__item--type-date\">\n<time>May 31, 2012</time>\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n</a>\n</li>\n<li class=\"elementor-icon-list-item elementor-repeater-item-11e4921 elementor-inline-item\">\n<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-icon\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-far-clock\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M256 8C119 8 8 119 8 256s111 248 248 248 248-111 248-248S393 8 256 8zm0 448c-110.5 0-200-89.5-200-200S145.5 56 256 56s200 89.5 200 200-89.5 200-200 200zm61.8-104.4l-84.9-61.7c-3.1-2.3-4.9-5.9-4.9-9.7V116c0-6.6 5.4-12 12-12h32c6.6 0 12 5.4 12 12v141.7l66.8 48.6c5.4 3.9 6.5 11.4 2.6 16.8L334.6 349c-3.9 5.3-11.4 6.5-16.8 2.6z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-text elementor-post-info__item elementor-post-info__item--type-time\">\n<time>12:00 am</time>\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b78a6df e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"b78a6df\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-302d081 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"302d081\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e309f77 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-id=\"e309f77\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<p>To solve this hydration problem, they assigned one of their top scientists, Professor Victor M. Inyushin, who developed a multi-stage restorative system. This system included the Bio-Plasma Generator and the Geometrical Crystal Field. The Bio-Plasma generator is a device that contains a living vegetable fiber grown and preserved in the vacuum state, which produces a mini-voltage output and creates an energy field that the re-cycled water passes through. The Geometrical Crystal Field creates a biologically compatible frequency that imprints information created by the geometrical figures in natural crystalline structures, such as those in water from natural sources.</p>\n<p>Professor Inyushin has licensed a U.S. based company. Revitalized Technologies, Inc. who further developed this technology to concentrate the plasma and maximize the zeta potential, which multiplies the water&#8217;s subtle frequencies, in an effort to make it affordable and effective. The company has a number of scientific verification methods for this proven technology, including changes in surface tension, boiling point, and nuclear magnetic resonance, which show smaller organized clusters known as structured water. Over the years, we, at Hippocrates Wellness have been acutely interested in finding more effective methods of enhancing the hydration of the human cell. Adequate hydration significantly accomplishes a primary objective of creating greater electrical frequency among all tissues within the human body. By activating organ, neurological, and brain organ systems, one&#8217;s immunity is heightened and balanced.</p>\n<p>Approximately one year ago we began experimenting with the resulting water from this Russian technology. there are three clear advantages that we unveiled at Hippocrates when the water is consumed on a daily basis:</p>\n<ol></ol>\n</p>\n<li>HIGHER LEVELS OF NUTRIENT ABSORPTION FROM BOTH FOOD AND WHOLE FOOD SUPPLEMENTATION.</li>\n</p>\n<li>GREATER OXYGENATION OF THE RESPIRATORY SYSTEM (TESTED WITH AN OXOMETER).</li>\n</p>\n<li>DEHYDRATION IS MINIMIZED IN CASES OF HEIGHTENED EXERTION, NAUSEA AND FEVER.</li>\n<p>Each of these attributes is significant in and of themselves, yet in combination, they assist in everyone&#8217;s healthcare from athletes to people suffering with chronic disease.</p>\n<p>Currently, we offer Revitalized Water to add to all of your drinking and therapeutic water. At the time of this writing we are beginning to develop an enriched Revitalized H<sub>2</sub>0, which will include amino acids and silica. This low cost, high-tech method of enhancing your body&#8217;s frequency is one of the primary steps for ensuring a Vibrant rife. For more on Revitalized water Visit call the Hippocrates Store at 561.471.8876, ext. 124.</p>\n<p><em>Vol 24 Issue 4 Page 22</em></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9e8190e e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"9e8190e\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-46f24f0 elementor-widget-divider--view-line elementor-widget elementor-widget-divider\" data-id=\"46f24f0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"divider.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<div class=\"elementor-divider\">\n<span class=\"elementor-divider-separator\">\n</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b1a558b e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"b1a558b\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-696bbaf elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"696bbaf\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<p>Continue exploring</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-107bf35 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"107bf35\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">More from the journal</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bef783f elementor-grid-3 elemento